{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089530/extras/e587f0fe0983b542215a5d2d307f2dac.avif?t=1759011214\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Kiefer. K, a freelance journalist investigating a secret government facility near the town of Rushworth, Australia. Shortly after arriving things take a turn for the worst and you end up at the bottom of a dark abandoned mineshaft. Can you discover the secrets of this facility and escape to tell the story?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089530/extras/c35fd4da8c2bce971c987f4a95579544.avif?t=1759011214\" width=1522 height=516 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>PARAWYRM</i> is a first person action/\u00a0<i>survival-horror\u00a0</i>game created by <i>M. Lang</i> and is inspired by titles like <i> Half-Life and Resident Evil</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>F E A T U R E S</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Around 2 - 6 hours play time</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Wield a Cricket Bat, a Gun and more!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Atmospheric &amp; immersive environments</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fight humans, insects &amp; the paranormal</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Collectables</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Lite puzzles</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Late 1990's rural Australia setting</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Pixelated retro aesthetic</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Created by one man with a dream</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"